VENDORED  (copied near-verbatim; `lehome.*` imports rebased to
           `humanoid_garment_fold.*`; a console-only logger shim swapped in)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

humanoid_garment_fold/assets/garment_object.py
    <- source/lehome/lehome/assets/object/Garment.py
       MODIFIED: `_get_asset_path()` / `_apply_visual_material()` now honour a
       real absolute filesystem path before falling back to upstream's
       "/-prefixed == git-root-relative" rule (2 lines, marked inline). No other
       change.

humanoid_garment_fold/utils/success_checker_garment.py
    <- source/lehome/lehome/utils/success_checker_chanllege.py      (unchanged)

humanoid_garment_fold/tasks/challenge_garment_loader.py
    <- source/lehome/lehome/tasks/bedroom/challenge_garment_loader.py  (unchanged)

humanoid_garment_fold/config/particle_garment_cfg.yaml
    <- source/lehome/lehome/tasks/bedroom/config_file/particle_garment_cfg.yaml
       (unchanged)

humanoid_garment_fold/tasks/garment_env.py
    <- source/lehome/lehome/tasks/bedroom/garment_bi_v2.py
       MODIFIED: removed `_get_workspace_pointcloud()` (drops the
       `lehome.utils.depth_to_pointcloud` dep: scipy + plotly) and
       `preprocess_device_action()` (drops the `lehome.devices.action_process`
       dep: SO101-leader / keyboard teleop). Both marked inline. No logic change
       to scene / reward / success / reset.

humanoid_garment_fold/tasks/garment_env_cfg.py
    <- source/lehome/lehome/tasks/bedroom/garment_bi_cfg_v2.py
       MODIFIED: removed the `lehome.assets.robots.lerobot` import and the two
       `SO101_FOLLOWER_CFG`-based `left_robot` / `right_robot` fields -- a
       concrete subclass now supplies the robot. Asset paths point at this
       package's `vendor_assets/` and `config/`.

humanoid_garment_fold/assets/scene.py
    <- source/lehome/lehome/assets/scenes/bedroom.py + utils/constant.py
       MODIFIED: resolves the scene USD from `vendor_assets/` instead of a
       git-root `Assets/` tree.

