------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ASSETS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

vendor_assets/garments/Release/{Top_Long,Top_Short,Pant_Long,Pant_Short}/*
    One sample garment per category from the LeHome `asset_challenge` set,
    redistributed here (Apache-2.0) for local testing. Full set (48 variants):
    `hf download lehome/asset_challenge`.

vendor_assets/scenes/Table038/
    Standalone table from the same asset set (Apache-2.0), used as a fallback
    work surface when the apartment USD is absent.

Scene_00_Apartment.usd -- NOT redistributed here (~19 MB, .gitignore'd).
